flowchart TB
  C[Campaign: Targets, Sites, Controls, Thresholds, Scale] --> S[Typed Stage]
  P[Profile: Provider, Environment, Resources, Caps] --> S
  A[Adapter: Role, Capabilities, Revisions, Argv, Parser] --> S
  I[Normalized Input Artifact And Hash] --> S
  S --> X[Toolcheck]
  X --> Y[N=1 Smoke]
  Y --> Z[Smoke Parser And Output Hashes]
  Z --> W[Scale]
  W --> W1[Scale Parser, Exact Counts, And Hashes]
  W1 --> WS[Validate Registered Artifact Schema]
  WS --> OW[Hash Sequences, Design Poses, Complexes, PAE, And Metric Sources]
  OW --> O[Publish Normalized Outputs As One Transaction]
  O --> R[Stage Receipt And Identity Hash]
  R --> RV[Revalidate Manifest And Referenced Files On Resume]
  RV --> N[Next Adapter Role]
